questions.question_text:
The circle shown has its centre and radius marked. Determine its equation.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.55]
\draw[<->] (-2,0)--(8,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-7)--(0,3) node[above] {$y$};
\coordinate (C) at (3,-2);
\draw[thick,blue] (C) circle (4);
\fill (C) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above right] at (C) {$(3,-2)$};
\draw[dashed] (C) -- (7,-2) node[midway, above] {$4$};
\fill (7,-2) circle (2pt);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
